  {
   "id": "ercot_fuel_mix",
   "name": "ERCOT Fuel Mix",
   "description": "Fuel Mix for ERCOT aligned to 5 minute intervals.\n\nERCOT reports instantaneous generation readings approximately every five minutes. This dataset resamples those readings to consistent five-minute intervals, averaging readings within each interval and linearly interpolating gaps.\n\nData before December 15, 2022 is sourced from [ERCOT\u2019s historical 15-minute generation totals](https://www.ercot.com/gridinfo/generation/index.html). These totals are converted from MWh to average MW, with the same value used for each of the three five-minute intervals.\n\nFor the readings before resampling, see [ERCOT Fuel Mix Instantaneous](https://www.gridstatus.io/datasets/ercot_fuel_mix_instantaneous).",
   "earliest_available_time_utc": "2017-01-01T06:00:00+00:00",
